  "question": {
    "text": "For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math>, let the solutions of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>cot</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>&nbsp;be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi></math>, where the inverse trigonometric functions take only principal values. If the solutions of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is equal to ______."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "12",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>cot</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math></p><p>Now simplifying&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>cot</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math></p><p>becomes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>cot</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math></p><p>And now solving&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cot</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cotcot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><msqrt><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></msqrt></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>cot</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;becomes&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math></p><p>Now solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>So, roots are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now finding&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So, sum of roots of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Product of roots of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mi>Put</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>in</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
